# --- @fill: housing prepositions ---------------------------------------------
# The fixed noun phrase makes every preposition tile uniquely grammatical.

@fill
@lu D'Botzgeschier ass [am] Schaf hannen.
@en The cleaning equipment is [in] the cupboard at the back.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu bei
@distractor-lu ënner
@distractor-en on
@distractor-en by
@distractor-en under

@fill
@lu De Staubsauger steet [bei] der Wäschmaschinn am Keller.
@en The vacuum cleaner stands [by] the washing machine in the cellar.
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu ënner
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en on
@distractor-en under

@fill
@lu D'Appartement läit [op] dem zweete Stack.
@en The apartment is [on] the second floor.
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu bei
@distractor-lu ënner
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en by
@distractor-en under

@fill
